    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>101</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>100</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>100</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>100</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>100</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>100</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>100</mn></msup><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mrow><mi>No</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>term</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>256</mn></msup></mrow></munder><mo>-</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>100</mn></msup></mrow><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mrow><mi>we</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>find</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>coffic